<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Sanat Mharolkar" .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Represents a remote operator's awareness state of a remotely operated vehicle and its surroundings: what information is available to the operator, what the operator has perceived from it, how delayed and degraded it is, whether it is still valid, and whether it is sufficient for the SA type of the operator's mode."@en .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-11-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SA-10 and the actuator latency part of SA-24 need ROVO-link loaded as well (its actuator latency observations); the other questions need only this module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remote Operation of Vehicles Ontology: operator awareness module"@en .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/rovo/link> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0" .
