<https://w3id.org/rovo/op#InclinationCue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/rovo/op#InVehicleCue> .
<https://w3id.org/rovo/op#InclinationCue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SA-16."@en .
